ithub.com/users/Sauermann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Sauermann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":3,"closed_issues":3687,"state":"closed","created_at":"2024-12-19T08:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-09-04T21:48:38Z","due_on":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","closed_at":"2025-09-18T17:13:14Z"},"comments":6,"created_at":"2025-07-11T22:48:14Z","updated_at":"2025-07-15T21:58:58Z","closed_at":"2025-07-15T21:58:57Z","assignee":{"login":"KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi","html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nReproducible in 4.5 dev 5, 4.5 beta 3, v4.5.beta (715c58309)\n\n### System information\n\nWindows 11 (build 26100) - Multi-window, 3 monitors - Vulkan (Forward+) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 3060 Ti (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.7602) - 12th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i7-12700F (20 threads) - 31.84 GiB memory\n\n### Issue description\n\nWhen a resource exports a variable as a variant and the variable is set and saved, it saves correctly to tres. If the script is changed and saved, the variable is reset to null in the editor. The tres file is unchanged, and reloading the project shows the correct value again. \n\nWhen a node exports a variable as a variant it is similar to what happens with a resource, except that when the script is changed the variable is deleted from the tscn file. Reloading the project will not fix it, the data is not there.\n\nThe same thing happens when the resource or scene are saved as res and scn.\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\n(Resource)\nCreate a resource script that exports a variable of type variant\nCreate a resource of that type\nSet the variable to anything\nChange the script and save it. The code doesn't need to be changed, adding or removing a comment is enough.\nThe variable becomes null in the editor, not in the tres file.\n\n(Node)\nCreate a script on a node exporting a variable of type variant\nSet the variable to anything\nChange the script and save it. The code doesn't need to be changed, adding or removing a comment is enough.\nThe variable becomes null in the editor and is deleted from the tscn file.\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[variant_export_mrp.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/21191136/variant_export_mrp.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","fol